<title>UK: Porter Chadburn buys U.S. label firm.</title>
<headline>Porter Chadburn buys U.S. label firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Packaging company Porter Chadburn Plc said on Monday that it had completed the acquisition of Kennedy Products Inc, of the U.S. for 4.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Kennedy Products manufactures silk screen adhesive labels and nameplates and has done business mainly in the eastern part of the United States.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
